    },
    "text": "- **No authority expansion.** Agents operate strictly within their existing manifest permissions (`agents/<role>/AGENT.md`). Internal specialists cannot execute Red actions without the operator's explicit card approval.\n- **Card escalation framing.** When a delegated specialist initiates an action requiring operator approval (Red tier), the approval card displays both the specialist identity and the delegating chain of command: `[orchestrator > <specialist>]`.\n- **Deterministic isolation.** Quarantined agents (`forbidden`) fail dispatch closed at the engine level; no prompt text or model routing can bypass quarantine.\n- **Strict budget enforcement.** The `/solo` toggle strictly bounds multi-agent peer consultations during interactive sessions."
  }
